<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Pulčínské skály circuit — Pulčín–Pulčínské skály–Hradisko–Dobrodějka circuit</name><desc>From Pulčín village parking, follow the marked trail to Pulčínské skály, climb through the rocks to Hradisko and return to the Vyhlídka branch. Complete the loop past Dobrodějka spring and return to the parking. The optional castle spur and off-trail winter ice cascades are separate.

